<title>INDIA: INDIA RBI RAISES 42.5 BLN RUPEES AT REPO AUCTION.</title>
<headline>INDIA RBI RAISES 42.5 BLN RUPEES AT REPO AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it accepted all three bids it received for 42.5 billion rupees at a three-day repo auction on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
